        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.229,
            0.528,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. CoQ B. FMN C. Cyt D. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{NAD}^{+}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.257,
            0.677,
            0.274
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13. 脂肪酸合成时, 将乙酰- CoA 从线粒体转运至胞液的是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.279,
            0.818,
            0.296
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 乙醛酸循环 \nB. 柠檬酸穿梭 \nC. 磷酸甘油穿梭 \nD. 三羧酸循环"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.302,
            0.536,
            0.319
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14. 在糖酵解和糖异生作用中都起作用酶是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.325,
            0.851,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 己糖激酶 B. 丙酮酸激酶 C. 3-磷酸甘油酸脱氢酶 D. 丙酮酸羧化酶"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.37,
            0.456,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15. 由胆固醇转变而来的维生素是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.392,
            0.714,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 维生素 A \nB. 维生素 C \nC. 维生素 D3 \nD. 维生素 E"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.415,
            0.476,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16. 联结三羧酸循环和尿素循环的是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.438,
            0.85,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 天冬氨酸 B. 草酰乙酸 C. 天冬氨酸和瓜氨酸 D. 天冬氨酸和延胡索酸"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.483,
            0.516,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17. 下列哪种药物能抑制病毒 DNA 的复制"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.505,
            0.763,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 氨甲蝶呤 \nB. 阿糖胞苷 \nC. 6-巯基嘌呤 \nD. 5-氟尿嘧啶"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.528,
            0.496,
            0.545
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "18. 下列哪一项不属于逆转录酶的功能"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.55,
            0.848,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. 以 RNA 为模板合成 DNA \nB. 以 DNA 为模板合成 DNA \nC. 指导合成 RNA \nD. 水解 RNA-DNA 杂交分子中的 RNA 链"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.596,
            0.516,
            0.612
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "19. 合成后无需进行转录后加工的 RNA 是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.186,
            0.618,
            0.738,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. rRNA \nB. tRNA \nC. 原核细胞 mRNA \nD. 真核细胞 mRNA"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.641,
            0.546,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "20. 下列关于 H7N9 病毒的描述错误的一项是"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.186,
            0.663,
            0.616,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A. H 代表血细胞凝集素 \nB. N 代表神经氨酸酶 \nC. H 和 N 都是囊膜蛋白 \nD. H 和 N 都是核蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.726,
            0.573,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "四、判断题。是(v) 非(x)（共 20 分，每题 1 分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.749,
            0.553,
            0.766
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 蛋白质的三维结构与环境条件有直接关系。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.777,
            0.453,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 蛋白变性后分子量也随之改变。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.805,
            0.654,
            0.821
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 蛋白质组中蛋白质的数目有时可以超过基因组的数目。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.833,
            0.694,
            0.849
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 真核细胞的 DNA 全是线性的，而原核细胞的 DNA 是环状的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.861,
            0.513,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 所有酶抑制剂都直接作用于活性中心。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.888,
            0.848,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 病毒、原核生物和真核生物（包括细胞核和细胞器）都使用完全相同的遗传"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 3,
      "blocks": [
